    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15308" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρνειός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ram, wether</i> ( 
