				Att.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρνεώς.</span> Deriv. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρσην,</span> as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρσν-ηϝ-ό-ς,</span> cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρνευ-τήρ.</span> No initial <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝ-.</span>)</div>
